### What I saw

The real Agent-and-Runtime CPU journey (`tests/integrations/test_remote_machine_cpu.py`) takes 57 minutes for 26 tests, so nobody runs it and CI never has. Plan 50 RB-1 makes it run in the lane but sets no time bound. Not measured where the time goes.

Source: Release 13 live and offline runs, 11–12 Nov (smell 6) (interim file `observations/2026-11-12-cpu-journey-takes-57-minutes.md`, 2026-11-12)

